        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis, Count of Armagnac; Charlotte of Lorraine; Umberto II of Italy; Albert II, Prince of Monaco; Diana Álvares Pereira de Melo\n- Roles: Count of Armagnac; Princess of Lorraine; King of Italy; Duchess of Cadaval\n\nFacts:\n- Umberto II of Italy was born on 15 September 1904 and died on 18 March 1983.\n- Umberto II of Italy was the last King of Italy.\n- Charlotte de Lorraine-Armagnac was born on 6 May 1678 and died on 21 January 1757.\n- Charlotte de Lorraine-Armagnac was a Princess of Lorraine by birth and a daughter of Louis, Count of Armagnac.\n- Louis, Count of Armagnac, had descendants including Albert II, Prince of Monaco, Umberto II of Italy, and Diana Álvares Pereira de Melo, 11th Duchess of Cadaval.",
